    "type": "game",
    "name": "RENNSPORT",
    "steam_appid": 2077750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/7b1afaf641b5f766adaa46f7eb199b2b.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/bfb6dd433cd7a91fe49abd6a98cd60f5.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/bfb6dd433cd7a91fe49abd6a98cd60f5.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/bfb6dd433cd7a91fe49abd6a98cd60f5.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RENNSPORT</strong> is the playground car enthusiasts have been waiting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a photo-realistic racing simulation offering the highest levels of multiplayer competition. It is where gamers, drivers, pro athletes, modders, and car enthusiasts come together to drive, live, and share their passion for racing and special cars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/53d7ab2238bb78cf1fb29735ae28cb75.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ddaf788a20584ea0949db26cee7f6464.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ddaf788a20584ea0949db26cee7f6464.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ddaf788a20584ea0949db26cee7f6464.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive different car classes like <strong>GT3</strong>, <strong>GT4</strong>, <strong>Hypercars</strong>, and more in both single-class and multi-class races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/29e2253e9046ae2e7a28cdfd66174dce.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/6cb745422153075a181c6f1abc2abc79.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/6cb745422153075a181c6f1abc2abc79.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/6cb745422153075a181c6f1abc2abc79.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of racing at iconic locations like <strong>Autodromo Nazionale Monza</strong>, <strong>Circuit de Spa-Francorchamps</strong>, and <strong>Daytona International Speedway</strong>, among others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/27868c764bd1058c46cbc5d961b6a3bb.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/dde7859fda7611fd36d9e1da04fed95e.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/dde7859fda7611fd36d9e1da04fed95e.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/dde7859fda7611fd36d9e1da04fed95e.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive against other players of matching skill in multiplayer races or rise through the ranks in league racing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae850d500f9e0be783dad2e819b74803.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae96c0ed659f28c617914173fd063fc7.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae96c0ed659f28c617914173fd063fc7.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae96c0ed659f28c617914173fd063fc7.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show the world your skills by dominating the leaderboards in Time Trials, or challenge your friends directly with any car and track combination you can think of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/7b1afaf641b5f766adaa46f7eb199b2b.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/bfb6dd433cd7a91fe49abd6a98cd60f5.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/bfb6dd433cd7a91fe49abd6a98cd60f5.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/bfb6dd433cd7a91fe49abd6a98cd60f5.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RENNSPORT</strong> is the playground car enthusiasts have been waiting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a photo-realistic racing simulation offering the highest levels of multiplayer competition. It is where gamers, drivers, pro athletes, modders, and car enthusiasts come together to drive, live, and share their passion for racing and special cars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/53d7ab2238bb78cf1fb29735ae28cb75.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ddaf788a20584ea0949db26cee7f6464.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ddaf788a20584ea0949db26cee7f6464.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ddaf788a20584ea0949db26cee7f6464.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive different car classes like <strong>GT3</strong>, <strong>GT4</strong>, <strong>Hypercars</strong>, and more in both single-class and multi-class races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/29e2253e9046ae2e7a28cdfd66174dce.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/6cb745422153075a181c6f1abc2abc79.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/6cb745422153075a181c6f1abc2abc79.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/6cb745422153075a181c6f1abc2abc79.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of racing at iconic locations like <strong>Autodromo Nazionale Monza</strong>, <strong>Circuit de Spa-Francorchamps</strong>, and <strong>Daytona International Speedway</strong>, among others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/27868c764bd1058c46cbc5d961b6a3bb.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/dde7859fda7611fd36d9e1da04fed95e.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/dde7859fda7611fd36d9e1da04fed95e.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/dde7859fda7611fd36d9e1da04fed95e.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive against other players of matching skill in multiplayer races or rise through the ranks in league racing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae850d500f9e0be783dad2e819b74803.avif?t=1734700603\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae96c0ed659f28c617914173fd063fc7.poster.avif?t=1734700603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae96c0ed659f28c617914173fd063fc7.webm?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/ae96c0ed659f28c617914173fd063fc7.mp4?t=1734700603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show the world your skills by dominating the leaderboards in Time Trials, or challenge your friends directly with any car and track combination you can think of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
